# Kipuka EST — Server Health
Output docs/gifs/01-est-health.mp4
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 900
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# Kipuka EST Server Health — kipuka-rsa.cert-lab.local"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "./lab est-status -p rsa --verbose"
Enter
Sleep 8s
